{"seq":1,"slug":"raft-log-replication-model","title":"Raft 日志复制模型：term/index、日志匹配与提交推进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/etcd-raft-log-replication/raft-log-replication-model","wordCount":2506,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"raft-日志复制模型-term-index-日志匹配与提交推进\">Raft 日志复制模型：term/index、日志匹配与提交推进</h1><p>一次跨境下单请求打进网关，库存预占要在三个可用区的 etcd 上原子生效——这条写请求最终会变成 leader 内存里一条 <code>raftpb.Entry</code>，它的身份由两个整数唯一确定：<code>Term</code> 与 <code>Index</code>。Raft 把「哪条命令在哪个位置」的全部策略压缩成这两个字段加一条不变式：<strong>term 与 index 都相同的两条条目，命令必然相同</strong>（Ongaro &amp; Ousterhout, <em>In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm</em>, USENIX ATC 2014）。围绕这条不变式，leader 用 <code>matchIndex</code> 的多数派推进 <code>commitIndex</code>，follower 用 <code>prevLogIndex/prevLogTerm</code> 探测分歧并截断冲突尾部。本文拆开 <code>go.etcd.io/raft</code>（etcd 3.6 起 Raft 实现独立成模块，见 <a href=\"https://pkg.go.dev/go.etcd.io/raft/v3\">pkg.go.dev/go.etcd.io/raft/v3</a>）与 <code>etcdserver</code> 两侧，讲清条目身份、日志匹配、提交推进三个环节，以及 raft 索引与 etcd MVCC revision 的换算关系。批量发送与流控窗口属于复制流水线的另一半，见同 hub 章节内的 <a href=\"append-entries-pipeline-snapshot\">AppendEntries 批量流水线与快照追赶机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-条目-日志与三个索引\">核心概念：条目、日志与三个索引</h2><p>一条日志就是<strong>按 index 严格递增排列的条目数组</strong>，下标从 1 开始，位置永不移动。每个 <code>raftpb.Entry</code> 含四个字段：<code>Term</code>（创建该条目的任期）、<code>Index</code>（在日志中的位置）、<code>Type</code>（普通条目 / 配置变更 / 空条目）、<code>Data</code>（序列化后的命令）。<code>Term</code> 单调不减，<code>Index</code> 严格递增，两条规则共同把日志钉成一维序列。</p>\n<p>理解复制模型，要先分清三个容易混淆的索引，它们分别活在三个不同节点上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引</th>\n<th>归属</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>持久化位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>lastIndex</code> / <code>firstIndex</code></td>\n<td>每个节点</td>\n<td>本地日志的首尾（<code>firstIndex</code> 之后的部分已被压缩丢弃）</td>\n<td>由 WAL + 快照推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>matchIndex</code></td>\n<td>leader 为每个 follower 维护</td>\n<td><strong>已确认复制到该 follower</strong>的最高索引</td>\n<td>内存（<code>tracker.Progress.Match</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>commitIndex</code></td>\n<td>每个节点</td>\n<td>已知被多数派持久化的最高索引，此前条目可安全应用</td>\n<td><code>HardState.commit</code>，反复写入 WAL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>还有两个派生量：<code>appliedIndex</code>（已交给状态机执行的索引）与 <code>Next</code>（leader 下一条要发给某 follower 的索引）。它们不是同一件事——<code>commitIndex</code> 可以领先 <code>appliedIndex</code> 若干条，因为 apply 是异步的；<code>Next</code> 可以落后 <code>matchIndex</code>，因为消息在途。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[leader 收到提案] --&gt; B[追加到本地日志&lt;br/&gt;Index = lastIndex + 1, Term = currentTerm]&#10;    B --&gt; C[广播 MsgApp&lt;br/&gt;携带 prevLogIndex / prevLogTerm]&#10;    C --&gt; D{follower 在 prevLogIndex 处&lt;br/&gt;term 是否匹配?}&#10;    D --&gt;|不匹配| E[拒绝 MsgAppResp&lt;br/&gt;回自己的 lastIndex 供 leader 回退 Next]&#10;    D --&gt;|匹配| F[截断冲突尾部后追加新条目]&#10;    F --&gt; G[MsgAppResp: Match = 新 lastIndex]&#10;    G --&gt; H[leader 更新该 follower 的 matchIndex]&#10;    H --&gt; I{多数派 matchIndex&lt;br/&gt;≥ 候选索引 N?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| C&#10;    I --&gt;|是且该条 term = currentTerm| J[commitIndex = N]&#10;    J --&gt; K[CommittedEntries 应用到状态机]\">flowchart TD\n    A[leader 收到提案] --&gt; B[追加到本地日志&lt;br/&gt;Index = lastIndex + 1, Term = currentTerm]\n    B --&gt; C[广播 MsgApp&lt;br/&gt;携带 prevLogIndex / prevLogTerm]\n    C --&gt; D{follower 在 prevLogIndex 处&lt;br/&gt;term 是否匹配?}\n    D --&gt;|不匹配| E[拒绝 MsgAppResp&lt;br/&gt;回自己的 lastIndex 供 leader 回退 Next]\n    D --&gt;|匹配| F[截断冲突尾部后追加新条目]\n    F --&gt; G[MsgAppResp: Match = 新 lastIndex]\n    G --&gt; H[leader 更新该 follower 的 matchIndex]\n    H --&gt; I{多数派 matchIndex&lt;br/&gt;≥ 候选索引 N?}\n    I --&gt;|否| C\n    I --&gt;|是且该条 term = currentTerm| J[commitIndex = N]\n    J --&gt; K[CommittedEntries 应用到状态机]</pre><h2 id=\"日志匹配性质-term-index-二元组如何约束分歧\">日志匹配性质：term/index 二元组如何约束分歧</h2><p>Raft 的核心安全论证全部压在<strong>日志匹配性质</strong>（Log Matching Property）上，它由两条组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若两个日志中存在 <code>Index</code> 相同且 <code>Term</code> 相同的条目，则这两条条目存储<strong>相同的命令</strong>；</li>\n<li>若这两个条目的 term 相同，则它们<strong>之前的所有条目也逐条相同</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第一条来自 leader 的行为约束：leader 在一个 term 内、对给定 index 最多只创建一条条目，且从不改变已有条目的位置。第二条由归纳法保证——<code>AppendEntries</code> 携带 <code>prevLogIndex</code> 与 <code>prevLogTerm</code>，follower 只在本地 <code>prevLogIndex</code> 处的 term 与之相等时才接受追加。形式化地，对任意两个日志 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1, L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与任意索引 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>Term</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>Term</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1[i].\\text{Term} = L_2[i].\\text{Term} \\;\\Longrightarrow\\; \\forall j \\le i:\\; L_1[j] = L_2[j]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Term</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Term</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这正是 follower 能<strong>安全截断</strong>的依据。当一致性检查失败时，follower 不会盲目丢弃尾部，而是回报自己的 <code>lastIndex</code>，leader 据此把该 follower 的 <code>Next</code> 回退，重发更早的一段——<code>go.etcd.io/raft</code> 里这个回退通过 <code>Progress</code> 的状态迁移表达：<code>MsgUnreachable</code> 或快照失败会把该 follower 从 <code>Replicate</code> 打回 <code>Probe</code>，成功后重新进入流水线（<a href=\"https://pkg.go.dev/go.etcd.io/raft/v3\">pkg.go.dev/go.etcd.io/raft/v3</a>）。</p>\n<p>生产上最危险的场景是<strong>日志分叉被掩盖</strong>：老 leader 因 GC 停顿或跨区网络抖动被隔离，写入了若干未被多数派确认的条目；新 leader 上任后这些条目会被覆盖。这就是为什么 etcd 在文档里反复强调时钟与网络——<code>--heartbeat-interval</code> 默认 100ms、选举超时按 <code>ElectionTick = 10 × HeartbeatTick</code> 推导（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/configuration/\">etcd v3.6 配置文档</a>），跨可用区 RTT 若接近选举超时量级，follower 会频繁发起无效选举，把已经匹配的日志反复推翻重来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提交推进-matchindex-多数派与-commitindex\">提交推进：matchIndex 多数派与 commitIndex</h2><p>leader 推进 <code>commitIndex</code> 的规则比直觉更保守。设集群有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个投票成员，quorum 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor N/2 \\rfloor + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（3 节点是 2，5 节点是 3），leader 为每个 follower <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 维护 <code>matchIndex</code> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，自身 <code>matchIndex</code> 等于自己的 <code>lastIndex</code>。候选提交索引是满足多数派覆盖的最大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" lspace=\"0.05em\" rspace=\"0.05em\">|</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>j</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>i</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>Term</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\max\\left\\{\\, i \\;\\middle|\\; \\left|\\{\\, j : m_j \\ge i \\,\\}\\right| \\ge \\left\\lfloor \\tfrac{N}{2} \\right\\rfloor + 1 \\;\\wedge\\; L[i].\\text{Term} = T_{\\text{current}} \\,\\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2223em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Term</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>后半条 term 约束是 Raft §5.4.2 的安全补丁：<strong>leader 只凭当前 term 的条目推进 commitIndex</strong>，绝不直接提交前任留下的条目。上一 term 的条目只能通过「当前 term 有一条新条目被多数派复制」被顺带提交。没有这条约束，会出现 Figure 8 描述的反例：某条已被多数派写入的旧 term 条目，仍可能被后续选举覆盖。etcd 每次选举都会在任期内追加一条空条目（<code>EntryNormal</code> 之外的 no-op），正是为了尽快让新 term 的第一条被提交，从而解锁之前所有积压条目的提交状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>触发者</th>\n<th>前置条件</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>追加条目</td>\n<td>leader</td>\n<td>收到提案且 lead 状态有效</td>\n<td><code>lastIndex + 1</code>，广播 <code>MsgApp</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新 <code>matchIndex</code></td>\n<td>leader</td>\n<td>收到某 follower 成功 <code>MsgAppResp</code></td>\n<td>该 follower 进度前移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推进 <code>commitIndex</code></td>\n<td>leader</td>\n<td>多数派 <code>matchIndex</code> ≥ 候选且 term 匹配</td>\n<td><code>HardState.commit</code> 前进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用条目</td>\n<td>每个节点</td>\n<td>本节点 <code>commitIndex</code> &gt; <code>appliedIndex</code></td>\n<td>交给状态机，写入 bbolt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截断尾部</td>\n<td>follower</td>\n<td>一致性检查通过后发现冲突 term</td>\n<td>丢弃冲突段，保持匹配性质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一次 3 节点跨区集群的写入，要等两个节点（leader 自身 + 一个 follower）交叉可用区的 fsync 完成才能前进 <code>commitIndex</code>；把 follower 放到同城另一可用区、把第三个放到异地只做投票与灾备，是控制这条延迟的常见拓扑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-raft-索引到-etcd-revision-两套编号的换算\">从 Raft 索引到 etcd revision：两套编号的换算</h2><p>初学者最容易把 raft <code>Index</code> 与 etcd 的 <code>revision</code> 混为一谈，但它们是两套独立编号。raft <code>Index</code> 是<strong>共识日志的位置</strong>，每次追加 +1，包括空条目、配置变更、心跳触发的 no-op；<code>revision</code> 是 <strong>MVCC 键值存储的逻辑时钟</strong>，只在写入事务真正 apply 时递增（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/learning/api_guarantees/\">etcd v3.6 API 保证</a>）。一笔事务即使修改上千个键，也只消耗一个 revision。二者的关系是单向投影：<code>revision</code> 的每一次递增对应某条 raft 条目被应用，但反过来不成立。</p>\n<p>由此推出几个运维上必须记住的推论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>压缩以 revision 为准，不是 index</strong>。etcd 的 compact 参数 <code>--auto-compaction-retention</code> 与 <code>etcdctl compact &lt;rev&gt;</code> 操作的是 MVCC 历史窗口，它随后触发 raft 日志的物理截断，但两者进度并不一一对应。</li>\n<li><strong>快照恢复后 index 会跳跃</strong>。follower 落后到需要的条目已被压缩时，leader 改发 <code>MsgSnap</code>；恢复完成后该节点的 <code>lastIndex</code> 直接跳到快照末尾，中间若干 index 从未在本地出现过。</li>\n<li><strong><code>appliedIndex</code> 才是真实数据点</strong>。集群元数据里 <code>consistent_index</code> 记录 bbolt 已应用到哪个索引，它落后于 <code>HardState.commit</code> 是正常现象，但二者差距持续扩大意味着 apply 侧被拖住（大事务、磁盘 IO 抖动、bbolt 长事务）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>bbolt 元数据中 <code>consistent_index</code> 以 big-endian <code>uint64</code> 存储，与 WAL 里反复出现的 <code>HardState.commit</code> 共同构成崩溃恢复的锚点（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/learning/persistent-storage-files/\">etcd v3.6 持久化文件说明</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"持久化边界-ready-循环与-fsync-顺序\">持久化边界：Ready 循环与 fsync 顺序</h2><p>Raft 论文的复制模型有个隐含前提：<strong>落在网络上的字节，必须先落在磁盘上</strong>。<code>go.etcd.io/raft</code> 用 <code>Ready</code> 结构把这条义务显式交给调用方：一次 <code>Ready</code> 同时携带 <code>Entries</code>（要先落盘）、<code>HardState</code>（含最新的 <code>term/commit/vote</code>）、<code>Messages</code>（要发出去的网络消息）与 <code>CommittedEntries</code>（要应用的状态机输入）。库文档规定了一个不可调换的顺序——<strong>先持久化 <code>Entries</code> 与 <code>HardState</code>，再发送 <code>Messages</code>，然后应用快照与已提交条目，最后 <code>Advance()</code></strong>。若把顺序反过来，节点可能在日志尚未落盘时就对外承诺了某条条目，崩溃后该承诺消失，匹配性质被破坏。</p>\n<p>etcd 侧由 <code>etcdserver</code> 的 <code>raftNode</code> 循环消费这个 <code>Ready</code>：把条目批量写进 WAL 并 <code>fsync</code>，然后才把消息交给传输层。这解释了生产上一条反直觉的经验——<strong>复制延迟的第一大来源常常是 leader 自己的磁盘</strong>。WAL 的物理布局决定了成本：文件按 <code>%016x-%016x.wal</code>（序列号-首条目索引）命名，写满约 64MB 滚动一个，默认保留最近 5 个（<code>--max-wals</code>）；每个 WAL 帧带一个对<strong>所有历史记录累积</strong>的 CRC-32，因此损坏检测是有状态的（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/learning/persistent-storage-files/\">etcd v3.6 持久化文件说明</a>）。WAL 是纯追加的：同一 index 若因提案替换写了两遍，replay 时<strong>后写的覆盖先写的</strong>，<code>HardState.commit</code> 之前的条目才保证最终形态。</p>\n<p>跨区部署时，这条持久化边界会与网络延迟叠加。可以用一个粗略的预算来定位瓶颈：单次写提交的下界约等于</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>commit</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>fsync</mtext><mtext>leader</mtext></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>RTT</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>fsync</mtext><mtext>follower</mtext></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{commit}} \\approx \\max\\bigl(T_{\\text{fsync}}^{\\text{leader}},\\; T_{\\text{RTT}} + T_{\\text{fsync}}^{\\text{follower}}\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">commit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fsync</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leader</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RTT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fsync</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">follower</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 leader 的 <code>fsync</code> 超过了「跨区 RTT + follower <code>fsync</code>」，加机器或调大窗口都无济于事，唯一的解法是把 WAL 放到低延迟本地 NVMe，并把预占这类写合并成更少、更大的事务以摊薄每次 fsync。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Raft 日志是 index 从 1 起、位置永不移动的条目数组；<code>Term</code> 单调不减、<code>Index</code> 严格递增，二者共同构成条目的唯一身份。</li>\n<li><strong>日志匹配性质</strong>是全部安全论证的地基：同 index 同 term 的条目命令相同，且此前所有条目逐条相同。<code>prevLogIndex/prevLogTerm</code> 一致性检查是它在网络上唯一的执法点。</li>\n<li>leader 用多数派 <code>matchIndex</code> 推进 <code>commitIndex</code>，且<strong>只提交当前 term 的条目</strong>；旧 term 条目靠新 term 的 no-op 被顺带提交。</li>\n<li>raft <code>Index</code> 与 etcd <code>revision</code> 是两套编号：前者是共识日志位置（含空条目与配置变更），后者是 MVCC 逻辑时钟（每笔写事务 +1）。压缩、快照、<code>appliedIndex</code> 都以各自的口径推进。</li>\n<li>复制模型的隐含前提是「先落盘再发出字节」，<code>Ready</code> 结构把这个顺序义务显式化；跨区集群的提交延迟通常由 leader 的 WAL <code>fsync</code> 主导，而非网络。</li>\n<li>想继续看批量化发送、流控窗口与 <code>MsgSnap</code> 追赶的触发条件，读本章的 <a href=\"append-entries-pipeline-snapshot\">AppendEntries 批量流水线与快照追赶机制</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Raft 日志复制模型：term/index、日志匹配与提交推进","id":"raft-日志复制模型-term-index-日志匹配与提交推进"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：条目、日志与三个索引","id":"核心概念-条目-日志与三个索引"},{"level":2,"text":"日志匹配性质：term/index 二元组如何约束分歧","id":"日志匹配性质-term-index-二元组如何约束分歧"},{"level":2,"text":"提交推进：matchIndex 多数派与 commitIndex","id":"提交推进-matchindex-多数派与-commitindex"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Raft 索引到 etcd revision：两套编号的换算","id":"从-raft-索引到-etcd-revision-两套编号的换算"},{"level":2,"text":"持久化边界：Ready 循环与 fsync 顺序","id":"持久化边界-ready-循环与-fsync-顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"AppendEntries 批量流水线与快照追赶机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/etcd-raft-log-replication/append-entries-pipeline-snapshot"}}